{"id": "q3", "target_chain_ids": ["base_c2"], "focus": "coverage", "question": "If the vertical axis position were the intended metric, does the chart provide a clear, unambiguous ranking of all six points, or are any points at similar heights that would make the 'highest point' interpretation uncertain?"}
